OpenLoch: ten real driver stages; generic models; off
VSUP VCC 0 5.25
.model NPN_GENERIC NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=200 VAF=100 IKF=.1)
.model LED_RED D(IS=1e-20 N=2 RS=4)
